WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.320
We're starting the explanation.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.530
This episode is a tangent, its
contents are different from normal.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.870
The stage is a city like New York
from the old days.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:42.660
They actually passed a weird law
prohibiting songs.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:46.290
The minute people start singing,
they are arrested. What a dilemma.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.460
Oh, yeah.
Babbit's special ability is this.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.000
Watch.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.920
This stuff is not important!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:55.380
I'm Kurata Sana, the leader of the band who leads everyone in carefree, happy singing.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.970
Very cool, right?

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:00.600
He's the trumpet player,
Kamura Naozumi-kun.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.680
Boot boot.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.890
Do you want to try to play
the trumpet?

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.980
He came out, the white bat.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.850
BA BI BU BA BI BO RON

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:13.230
Tomita Mayu-chan, the special agent responsible for arresting violators of the song law.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.780
No one's allowed to sing.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.950
Ayano Hanamaru Koji Tomomi-chan is
a special agent too.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.780
Playing instruments is against the
law too.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:23.120
My band mates Tsuyoshi-kun,
Aya-chan, and Hisae-chan.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.040
We still like each other even in
this weird episode.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.750
We'll try our best.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.790
Those who sing on the streets have been arrested one-by-one.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.130
This has created a huge uproar.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.750
Rabbit-suit guy is here too. He's just like normal and has a big head.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.050
Oh, this is the saxophone player,
Obanachi.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.010
You've been arrested too?

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.590
I'm Obana. I want to play!

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.550
Arrest her! Arrest her!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.470
Just now we brought you a live
broadcast from the streets.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.270
We saw the occurrence of Obana's arrest.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.770
Now we're reporting on the people
who are singing in a nearby small-town park.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.690
They won't be arrested.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.940
Only the people singing on that
particular street will be arrested.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.950
Only on the street where Sana-chan lives.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.240
It's too weird.
What kind of logic is this?

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.870
Where's the logic?
I really don't understand.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.330
They're basically challenging
me to a fight.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.620
I'm going to sing!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:13.960
To sing again. 3,2,1

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.550
The city Sana-chan lives in is
a port.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:25.050
It's ben a long time since I've
been back!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.470
I thought I was never going to
return here.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.560
Even though, you still don't have to strike this pose!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.060
It's so uncool!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.860
This right hand under your chin is the main feature of this pose.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.070
Oh, yeah. The man of the sea,
Zenjiro-chan,

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.030
will start doing some things
to attract the hot babes of this port.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.040
Arrest him!
You're not allowed to sing!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.330
Ok, Zenjiro-chan, good work.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.880
What?!
I was just for a moment!

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:54.830
Oh, yeah.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.670
Welcome to Sana's club.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.890
Sing! Sing!
Everyone sing together!

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.890
Sing! Sing! Even when it's against
the law, we still want to sing.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.350
Using the law
to prohibit singing is wrong.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.020
Such a weird law.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.480
They're still trying to prevent
people from singing in this day and age.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.440
What... is it the cops?

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.280
Ha, ha, ha. Caught in the act.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.620
Everyone singing loudly
at Kurata Sana's club.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.750
I'm the special agent, Tomita Mayu.
I'm going to arrest everybody here.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.500
What? Arrest everyone?

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.000
But there are some present who didn't sing.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.210
How do you know who sang
and who didn't to make your arrest?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.170
I didn't sing!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.930
I didn't sing either!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:50.930
See! See! No one sang! I didn't sing either! I was only shouting rhythmically.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.730
Oh, what a problem! What a pain!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.600
Excuse me!
According to the rule book,

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.440
if you speak with emotion,
it counts as singing.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.980
Ah, I'm Ayano Hanamaru Koji Tomomi.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.820
Does everyone remember me?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.400
Babbit remembers.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.780
Please continue.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.910
Sana-chan said something she
shouldn't have.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.120
Talk about digging your own grave.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.580
Oh no... Everyone run!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.660
Wait a minute!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.130
To be tricked by those people and
then to let them escape, how can I stand it?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.590
I understand!
Let's play a trick on them.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.880
Can you?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.090
Just watch me.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.550
No way you can do it!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.220
Eh! This won't work?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.010
You didn't even do anything.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.640
Agent Tomita. What?

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:33.770
Everyone's gone.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.270
- They all escaped.
- What?! Those idiots.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.940
Mayu-chan and her team returned to the police station.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.480
I didn't catch even half a person.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.190
I broke through wall,
I had control of the situation...

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.610
and I didn't even catch half a person.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:50.740
Mayu, Mayu is an incompetent agent.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.950
Because of this incident, I've been
reduced to despair by Kurata Sana.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.870
Boss, are you even listening to me?

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.830
You're even snoring!
What are you doing?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.880
Sanekichi, it's been a long time!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.170
Sorry! I fell asleep.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.470
Boss! Did you hear my complaints?

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:11.140
Don't worry! Just work harder
tomorrow.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.260
What's the meaning of this?!

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.560
I haven't appeared in a long time and I'm instantly taken out.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.560
Wait a minute! Wait a minute!
It hurts.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.230
Who is in charge here?

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.780
What? What's the matter?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.580
Zenjiro-chan.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.000
Sane-yan.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.000
The best money partner.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.930
Quiet! Arrest these two people!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.550
Ah, we accidentally sang!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.550
This time I'm really out
permanently.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:55.640
The boss has been arrested. That
means his position is empty.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.350
Is that funny?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:03.020
Yes. This means
I can take over his position.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.730
Yo, Tomita.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.030
Brad, why are you sitting here?

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.700
Because I'm your new boss.
Nice to meet you, baby.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.110
A bunch of idiots.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.530
A passenger ship has entered the
harbor.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.710
Ah! I'm entering a new country!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.420
It really is Naozumi-kun!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.830
I'm a wandering trumpet player.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.960
What new songs will this country
inspire in me.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:27.760
Are you okay?

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.470
Oh, yeah, I'll play a piece to express my current feelings!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.550
Please play beautiful melodies,
my trumpet.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.970
If you play a note,
you'll be arrested!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.560
Geez! I forgot to put on the
mouthpiece.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.770
If I don't have it,
I'm unable to play.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.360
Ok! Let's try again.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.530
I'm telling you, don't play. No.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.860
It's really cold here.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.740
I should find some place warm
and eat something hot.

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.030
It's really sad.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.450
It's work.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.160
Now, where should I go?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.040
Are you looking for a place?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.920
I know a place that's very
suitable for trumpet players.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.580
I'll take you there.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.210
Thank you very much.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.220
Aren't you singing, Aya-chan?

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.600
Tsuyoshi-kun,
do you want to sing together?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.760
I can't.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:19.850
We're here.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.730
Sana-chan, I've brought another
customer.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.190
Hi, Hisae-chan.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.020
I found him at the harbor,
his name's Naozumi-kun.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.520
I heard that he can play the
trumpet.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.190
I'm Kamura Naozumi.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.110
I've just arrived here.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:34.450
One of the performers doesn't look
too good. Let Naozumi try.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.240
Everyone, let's hear the music of
Naozumi-kun.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.660
Enough!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.830
I'm special agent Tomita Mayu.
It's my second appearance here tonight.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:49.340
You never thought I would show up here twice in one night, right?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.090
I was counting on that.
You let down your guard, didn't you?

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.550
This time, I've come prepared.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.180
Everyone who sang has been photographed by this camera.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.260
I've captured everyone who's sung.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.930
No one has escaped my net.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.730
You can no longer sing.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.310
He's the type you like, right?

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.020
You're under arrest.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.440
Wait a minute!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.860
This person is only holding an
instrument. He hasn't started playing.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.160
He's not breaking the law.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.780
Just now he produced a note.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.040
This person, I don't know where she was just now. Yet she had the nerve to talk nonsense.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.330
However, there really was a trumpet
sound just now.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:29.380
Right here! But you can hear a
little sound like that.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.420
Where could Tomomi have been at
the time?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.210
She was here!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.170
She was chatting it up at the bar,

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.720
and she was in uniform,
why wasn't she discovered?!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.600
Here.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.520
How can she hear such a soft sound
from all the way over there?

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.810
What weird powers does she have?

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.650
In that case, I must arrest
Naozumi-kun.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:53.440
That was the sound of me farting.
It was the sound of my fart.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.030
Sorry, that I caused your mix-up.
Please don't be mad.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.160
Was it farting?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.070
Yes, yes. It was a Boooo sound.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.950
I actually said it was the sound of a fart in front of him.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.580
If I had known beforehand, I would have said that it was Kurata Sana's fart.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.040
But now, I can't get out of it.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.130
However, I'm now considered to be
a farting woman by Naozumi-kun.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.800
Yo, farting woman.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:18.090
Anyway, hurry up and throw away
the trumpet.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.010
Otherwise, the instant you blow a
note, I'll have t arrest you.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.300
Understand?

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.430
He's even cuter close-up.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.150
People are not allowed to play the
trumpet in this town?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.860
Yes! It's prohibited here.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.480
Have we arrested Kurata Sana yet?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.860
She escaped.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.570
What?! She can't have gone far.
After her!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.250
That's the kind of
place this town is.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.130
You must be very disappointed,
Naozumi-kun.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.710
But, I can't give up my trumpet.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:58.130
That's right! Even though it's against the law, strange laws are hard for people to obey.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.800
Yes, it's a very strange law.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.430
They actually prohibit singing.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.180
Yes, but we'll never give in.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.640
However, it looks like Mayu-chan
was really interested in Naozumi-kun.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.020
Let's hurry up and get out from here.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.980
At that time, I really did play
the trumpet.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.900
However, that female agent...

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.190
that girl named Mayu,
why did she protect me?

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:27.910
{parte b}

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.420
Come on! To rescue the people who
were arrested, let's go!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.800
Naozumi-kun,
hurry up and lift us up.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.630
Tsuyoshi-kun has already fainted.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:40.930
Ah! So weird!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.130
What a mess.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.590
Stop playing around.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.890
Bring them all in!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.350
Wait a minute!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.770
Please release everyone.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.730
They broke the law.
We can't release them.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.940
That law violates human rights.
I won't recognize it.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.570
Jump!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.570
They escaped again!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.160
The revival of the club

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:05.280
There's nothing you can do if they've escaped.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.660
If Mayu-san discovers the truth,
you're all dead.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:13.290
Police Restroom

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:13.290
Occupant: Mayu

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.330
Handsome Naozumi...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.120
Naozumi.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.710
I've swept away the dust in
the corners.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.550
Why would that person come to
this town?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.420
Could it be so that he and
I could meet?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.130
Silly, what am I saying?
That's impossible.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.260
No. It's possible.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:29.890
You and I were fated to meet.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:34.350
That's right! My reason for being
on this earth was to meet Naozumi.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:36.730
lmaginary Picture

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:43.650
The whirlpool of happiness.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.120
Finished sweeping.
The place is now very clean.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.420
This person, don't tell me that
she was here this whole time?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.170
If that's the case,
then I'm through.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.710
I think that I was singing
just now. I'm in a pinch.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.260
Ha, Angel-san.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:07.800
Angel-san? Doesn't she notice the
people around her?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.060
Let me test this out.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.680
This will give me an excuse if I get in trouble.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.860
Hello, Ayano Hanamaru Koji-san.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.860
Yes!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.360
You're here too, Mayu-san.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.820
What are you doing over there?

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.160
I'm washing my hands.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.990
When did you come in?

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.950
I just got here a little while ago.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.910
Just got here plus a little while
ago makes it very hard to determine...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.710
Mayu-san, were you singing just
now?

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.620
I thought that I heard singing.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.580
Not me.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.300
The weather is so nice today.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.510
Yes! I understand.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.800
It's almost nighttime.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.850
Yeah! Sana's club!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.810
Absolutely no problem! No problem!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:01.690
I'll reform once I finish singing
this song.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.110
Just like this, everyone's happily
singing.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.530
Don't treat us like idiots.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.830
The radical for the Sa of Kurata
Sana-chan is the radical that means... silk.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.920
Na means south like east, west,
south, north.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.790
Not the na for cow's stomach.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.920
It's the direction south.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.250
Even though it's written as south
it's pronounced na.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.630
Good evening, everyone!
We're the police.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.680
We're here to arrest anyone who
dares break the song prohibition law.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.180
Ah, we're screwed!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.930
This time we won't let you escape.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:32.970
Oh, we fell!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.310
Sing! Sing! Sing your hearts out!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.440
So you thought you could escape singing at the sea?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.440
This time we won't let you escape.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.480
You did well to discover this place.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.070
I don't know how
I discovered this place either.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.320
I just used a small trick.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.570
In the trumpet...

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:50.450
- Give me back my trumpet...
- This trumpet...

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.620
Give it back now!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.490
If you press this valve...

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:57.370
I placed this Burutcha inside
the trumpet.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.040
Please don't copy this, people.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.540
Thanks to Agent Tomita,
we were able to plant this tracker.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.210
During yesterday's ambush.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.500
When Agent Tomita was pretending
to protect Naozumi-kun.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.130
I pretended to forcefully
hit the wall.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.220
It wasn't on purpose, was it?

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:16.430
Afterwards, the tracking device
just needed sound waves to activate.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.180
That's right... by using Naozumi.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.350
Agent Tomita, you are really good.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.980
I found a good helper.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:27.610
While you distracted Naozumi, I secretly hid the Burutcha.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.110
Good job, Tomita.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.570
No...

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.320
Don't look at me like that,
Naozumi-kun.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:38.370
It is nothing without music.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.750
I don't want it. I don't want
a life without music.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.130
Mayu-chan.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.250
Captured Kurata.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.050
- That's right.
- We've got her! We did it!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.630
There's something strange!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.640
Brad, even though you thought it
happened this way,

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.010
in reality it didn't.

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:00.770
Using Naozumi-kun was something that you came up with all by yourself.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.980
Is it? It doesn't matter!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.230
Of course it matters.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:08.690
At that time, Mayu-chan was protecting Naozumi-kun following her heart.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.320
We think so too.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.030
See! Everyone who saw it thinks so too.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.200
You can't step all over someone's
true emotions.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.530
I think so too.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:20.080
Can't hold him any longer.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.920
Thank you very much for protecting
me that time.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.960
However, that sound wasn't
the sound of a fart.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.590
It was the sound of a trumpet.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.090
I played it.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.720
He confessed.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.800
It wasn't!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:33.760
Right! It wasn't!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.300
It really was the sound of a fart.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.720
It was the sound of
Tsuyoshi-kun's fart.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.520
It's okay. Let's just pretend it
happened this way.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:40.520
Okay?

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.730
We've decided that it was
the sound of Tsuyoshi-kun's fart.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.860
Thank you.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.440
Naozumi-kun.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.610
Please go to another city.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.240
You can't play a trumpet here.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:59.280
If things go on this way, one of
these days, I'll have to arrest you.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.790
I...

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.250
...don't want to arrest you.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.710
I understand.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:14.340
However, I don't understand why
there's a law that prohibits singing.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:18.430
I will fight until stupid laws
such as the song prohibition law are repealed.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.720
Mayu-chan...

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.890
Shaking from side to side...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.850
I still want to play the trumpet.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.730
If you play it, I will arrest you.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.150
This is the outcome if you
persists in upholding the song prohibition law.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.910
You can't! Don't play it!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.080
Please don't play it.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.620
Naozumi-kun, you can't!
Please don't play it.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.130
Please don't play it, Naozumi-kun.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.460
I'm sorry.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:08.900
Naozumi-kun, I arrest you on
the charge of breaking the song prohibition law.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:15.690
I also think that the song
prohibition law is very strange.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:18.030
But the law must be obeyed.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.160
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.370
Sorry!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.240
I can't be captured yet.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.580
That's right. After hearing
Mayu-chan's true thoughts

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.580
the club has
to continue the struggle.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.380
The glove hat really suits me.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.340
Because knowing that this kind of
law won't defeat us,

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:35.760
it even creates problems for such
law-abiding people like Mayu-chan...

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.550
Until this strange law is
repealed,

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.590
the club will continue to fight.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:43.970
We'll work hard!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.810
When did you arrive?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.100
Everyone! The president wants to
announce something.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.350
Please look over there.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.810
Everyone, I'm really sorry
I passed such a weird law...

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:52.940
I've already repealed it.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:53.860
It's sushi.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.110
Mr. President, please tell us the
current state of the song prohibition law.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.950
It's been repealed! All of the
strange laws have been repealed.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.200
Because of this, all of the people
who were arrested will be set free.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.580
Oh, it's so hot!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.080
- I'm finally free.
- I'm Obana.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.410
Honestly!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.830
Let's sing, Mayu-san!
Let's sing, Sana-chan!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.040
You guys must really
want to sing, right?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.250
Right! Sing!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.800
Come! Come!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.470
The stage costumes have also been
prepared!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:34.480
Why would I start liking a guy
like that?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:40.280
The deer in my heart is jumping
around like crazy.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:46.200
The ship has set sail, but the
sound of its whistle still rings in my ears.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:50.460
The port city of love.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:58.460
You, while wearing a jacket of
patterned wool, have an easy-going... smile.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:04.340
You could say you're completely
not my type.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:10.310
I just can't say out loud that
I like you.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:14.060
Just like that the summer is over.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:22.150
The parting cassette tape is
the Last Memory.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.820
We pinky-swore

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:28.200
Like depart cutting the fingers

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:32.000
It disappeared into the blue sky.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:40.340
Love you, love you, love you love
you whistling.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:46.140
In order to have a perfect parting,
I can only pretend to be cool.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:51.730
Love you,
love you love you but now.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:55.980
I don't know why, but the tears
won't stop flowing.

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.150
Tastes good.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.610
- Hisae-chan, what are you eating?
- Sushi!

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.820
I really lost to them.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.660
Akito, do you like to eat sushi?!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:12.370
Sushi is my favorite food.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.960
Give me sushi! Give me!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.120
Who are you?

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.630
Everybody sing!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:22.130
Love you, love you, love you love
you walking the steps.

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:22.170
Everyone together.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:28.090
Dance on the dark bridge.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.550
Don't fall into the sea.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:33.680
Love you, love you, love you,
but now.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:37.810
This ship disappears in the waves.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:46.320
Love you, love you love you love
you whistling.

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:51.910
in order to have a perfect
parting, I can only pretend to be cool.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:57.580
Love you, love you love you,
but now.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.750
I don't know why, but the tears
won't stop flowing.

